      <activity id="6b35d3ed-2b68-5554-a1fb-27520a6650ad" activityNameId="9d569e29-61cb-52da-8aa6-d9a4730e4856" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sewer system, complete, GFRP pipe, SN 10000-20000, DN 800, profile 4</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sewer system, complete, GFRP pipe, SN 10000-20000, DN 800, profile 4
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: fbcbad12-5777-40e5-8db2-d9ad7c098f91
This process models 1 meter of sewer system infrastructure with GFRP pipe, DN 800, SN 10000-20000, profile 4 according to SIA 190. Trench depth: 3 meters. This process includes the production phase (A1–A3), the construction phase/ transport (A4–A5) as well as deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for one meter of sewer system with GFRP pipe.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Complete sewer system, DN 800, profile 4, SN 10000-20000, according to SIA 190.Trench depth 3 meters. GFRP pipe, ID 770-798 mm, outer diameter 821 mm, wall thickness 11-21 mm, 46-87 kg/m, 1650 kg/m³.  
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fbcbad12-5777-40e5-8db2-d9ad7c098f91.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
